\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  He who was crucified for me
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 is my only heart desire
\par I wish that it is same always
\par how pleased I am with it now
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par yet that is my heart's desire
\par all my intent and my plan
\par Whether in joy or O in pain
\par I'll love He who died on the cross.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. It is not hidden from my sight
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Whatever comes after love
\par Disgrace, trouble and all worries
\par Crosses and all struggles through
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yes if someone has true love
\par Even death is not frightening
\par Should I die O! or I won't die
\par I'll serve he who died on the cross
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Do you know what gives me joy?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Makes me brave and strengthen me?
\par To deny the flesh and Satan?
\par This world full of sin and lust
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par My love is strong and faithful;
\par What else do I still look for?
\par Which is on earth or in heaven
\par I'll  love He who died on the cross.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4. Love will pay the debt on that day
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 which is the royal wedding
\par When our King will take up the bride
\par whom He loves so dearly
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par When He will give them a crown
\par those who are the Faithfull ones
\par so the whole world will hear of it
\par \pard      I'll love Him who died on the cross. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

